WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.375
Clicking a creature picks that copy, so its values are the ones shown.

2
00:00:05.026 --> 00:00:09.526
One Image object, three copies. Each copy has its own values.

3
00:00:10.925 --> 00:00:15.225
Click Blaze. The event reads Blaze's power, speed and defence.

4
00:00:17.461 --> 00:00:21.536
Same event, a different copy. Now it reads Tide's values.
